{"1517090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elevator To Hell", "steam_appid": 1517090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elevator To Hell</strong> is a co-op survival game built for 1-4 players. Take the elevator to bite-sized levels filled with deadly puzzles, lurking threats, and things that shouldn't exist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/c89b71a3619f0a8d237e5c0e445f40ec.avif?t=1785943955\" width=597 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every floor is <strong>different</strong>. Every floor is <strong>dangerous</strong>. And nobody escapes alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/fbd944941f278e91e04dba10a8f1aff7.poster.avif?t=1785943955\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/fbd944941f278e91e04dba10a8f1aff7.webm?t=1785943955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/fbd944941f278e91e04dba10a8f1aff7.mp4?t=1785943955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/1838a8c788f1da40b1361d4636ff29b2.avif?t=1785943955\" width=608 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the elevator terminal to travel further down to tackle levels together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/c65258d82f4900c277185b596194a5c5.poster.avif?t=1785943955\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/c65258d82f4900c277185b596194a5c5.webm?t=1785943955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/c65258d82f4900c277185b596194a5c5.mp4?t=1785943955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/9d7ace3602903ddf40de6e826f4b8c3f.avif?t=1785943955\" width=608 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone's down? <strong>No worries</strong>, you  can 3D print them again and get another chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/50cddf1b6c3fde67a14942797fb570ec.poster.avif?t=1785943955\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/50cddf1b6c3fde67a14942797fb570ec.webm?t=1785943955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1517090/extras/50cddf1b6c3fde67a14942797fb570ec.mp4?t=1785943955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.. or nag fellow team players so that they reprint you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto